== Blacksmithing Leveling Guide ==
'''Strength or Intelligence or Wisdom, whichever is higher governs your chance to gain skill increases.'''
=== Getting Started (Up to 68) ===
(Updated for EQL recipes/trivials)

* '''1 to 21:''' [[Metal Bits]] and [[File]] 
** Buy 3 [[File Mold]], 53 [[Water Flask]], 100 [[Small Piece of Ore]] (~20pp). 
*** Do ~50 [[Metal Bits]] combines, and then 3 [[File]]. (Keep 1, sell extras)
*** You will want ~50 metal bits left after making your file.
* '''21 to 31:''' [[Sheet Metal]]
** Buy 30 [[Small Brick of Ore]], and some [[Water Flask]] if you don't have left over from the previous step. (keep sheet metal for later)
* '''41 to 68:''' [[Large Lantern]]
** Need to buy 50 [[Lantern Casing Mold]] and 50 [[Bottle|Bottles]] (~6pp). 
** Around fifty combines will use up your metal bits from earlier and get you to around 68. Sell Lanterns after to get some money back.

